ttps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107016","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107016.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107016.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds warning displayed when system fallback font is used, warning can be disabled from the project settings, only enabled for debug builds, and by default is displayed only when running from editor with attached debugger. It is not displayed when system fonts are used directly (using `SystemFont` class).\r\n\r\nWarning include used system font and text string that triggered it (without duplication):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1243\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-01 at 16 32 53\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb51b232-bea3-4743-a279-568dd0f441a8\" />\r\n\r\nSystem font fallback is useful, but is a constant source of confusion, since different platforms have different fallback capabilities and sets of available fonts.\r\n\r\nSee following issues for example, there are multiple other similar issues:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106824\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84590\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78921\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/77903\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107016/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107016/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}